---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Contact — RateTerrain" desc="Questions, corrections, or press: how to reach RateTerrain." path="/contact/">
<main class="wrap prose">
  <div class="hero" style="padding-bottom:8px">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h1>Get in touch</h1>
  </div>
  <p>Email is best: <b>hello@rateterrain.com</b></p>
  <ul>
    <li><b>Corrections.</b> If a number looks wrong, tell us the page and the figure. We check it against the source file and fix publicly — the correction note stays on the page.</li>
    <li><b>Press &amp; researchers.</b> Our datasets are built from public files; we're glad to share methodology details or custom cuts of the data.</li>
    <li><b>Everything else.</b> Feedback and ideas are welcome. We read all of it, even when we can't reply to each message.</li>
  </ul>
</main>
</Layout>
